#. Tag: para
#: contexthelp.docbook:2
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Many functions and views have help and hints that can be displayed with the "
"<emphasis>What's This</emphasis> function."
msgstr ""
"Moitas funcións e vistas teñen axuda e consellos que se poden amosar coa "
"funcionalidade <emphasis>Que é isto?</emphasis>."

#. Tag: para
#: contexthelp.docbook:4
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can activate it with the menu entry <menuchoice><guimenu>Help</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>WhatsThis</guimenuitem></menuchoice> or keyboard "
"shortcut <keycombo>&Shift;<keycap>F1</keycap></keycombo>."
msgstr ""
"Pode activala coa entrada de menú <menuchoice><guimenu>Axuda</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Que é isto?</guimenuitem></menuchoice> ou co atallo de "
"teclado <keycombo>&Shift;<keycap>F1</keycap></keycombo>."

#. Tag: para
#: contexthelp.docbook:6
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In dialogs it is activated by pressing the <varname>?</varname> in the "
"dialogs title bar."
msgstr ""
"Nos diálogos actívase premendo o <varname>?</varname> da barra de título."
